    <div class="next-grid">
      <a href="/docs/overrides" class="next-card">
        <div class="next-title">Overrides →</div>
        <div class="next-body">
          What an operator tunes on a running flock, and why a field baked
          into the child at exec waits for the next spawn instead of taking
          effect where it stands.
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/docs/first-flockfile" class="next-card">
        <div class="next-title">Your first Flockfile →</div>
        <div class="next-body">
          Every field a template can carry, and the grammar{" "}
          <code>{'{{secret:...}}'}</code> shares with{" "}
          <code>{'{{instance}}'}</code> and <code>{'{{name}}'}</code>.
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/docs/dogs" class="next-card">
        <div class="next-title">Dogs →</div>
        <div class="next-body">
          Writing a provider dog: what it gets on its environment, and how
          it stays connected across a reload.
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</DocsLayout>

